        "epoch": 1,
        "hypothesis": "A four-target by two-source micro-tile can expose independent sqrt/division pipelines while reducing live target state compared with the eight-target tile, improving ARM64 SIMD scheduling without reordering any body's force accumulation.",
        "id": "f31d1f1da27e42fc",
